Package: com.sahinkaa.clearcharge
Name: Clear Charge
Version: 1.0.1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Clear Charge removes the battery outline and percent sign when Battery Percentage is enabled. You get a plain number on the Home Screen, Lock Screen and in apps, with a bolt beside it when connected to power. The number stays in place when you plug in or unplug. The bolt dims when charging is on hold and the number turns amber in Low Power Mode.
Maintainer: sahinkaa
Author: sahinkaa
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 16.0), mobilesubstrate
